# Project overview

**Cross-Border** — self-hosted **AI agent hub** with scrape/catalog/export as a major capability.

## Runtime flow (gateway agent)

```
Panel chat / Telegram / cron
  → session + channel context
  → prompt = base + skills + agent rules
  → LLM tool loop (gateway/tools.py)
  → services / engine / deploy
```

**Orchestration boundary:** FastAPI gateway only. Web panel, CLI, and integrate runners are **clients**.

## Monorepo map

| Area | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| Agent panel | `apps/web/` | React + Vite, base `/ui/` — chat, skills, integrate, scrape UI |
| API | `src/server/` | FastAPI; register routers in `api/registry.py` |
| Gateway | `src/gateway/` | Agent runtime, **tools**, **skills**, schedules, **integrate** runners |
| Scrape & data | `src/core/`, `src/pipeline/` | Engine, plugins, product store, export |
| Deploy | `src/deploy/`, `libs/store_drivers/` | VPS scripts, drivers, firewall |
| Skills | `skills/` | Built-in `SKILL.md` playbooks for runtime agent |
| Runtime AI config | `libs/agent_rules/`, `libs/prompts/` | Panel agent policies + system prompts |
| Runtime config | `config/` (root) | YAML/JSON on disk |
| Settings code | `src/config/` | Python `Settings`, `.env` |

## Two agent systems (do not confuse)

| | Cursor (IDE) | Gateway (runtime) |
|---|--------------|-------------------|
| **Purpose** | Edit this repo | Operate panel / Telegram / cron |
| **Location** | `.cursor/rules/`, `AGENTS.md` | `src/gateway/`, `skills/`, `libs/agent_rules/` |

New **operator-facing** AI behavior → gateway tools/skills/rules — not Cursor rules.

